<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-BIRZHU MILK POSTS 7 MO 2.2 MLN NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-BIRZHU MILK POSTS 7 MO 2.2 MLN NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first seven months of 1997</p>
<p>					 (amounts in million litas)</p>
<p>    Net profit			2.2 vs  2.2</p>
<p>    Sales			    57.2 vs  51</p>
<p>Notes: Birzhu Milk , an official list stock on the</p>
<p>Vilnius bourse, posted a two million litas audited net profit</p>
<p>and 51.2 million litas in sales for the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35</p>
</text>
